# Suhba Backend Blueprint — Spring Boot 3

> Vienna-focused Muslim community PWA backend.
> Prayer spots + Halal spots in separate tables, proximity-sorted, crowd-sourced.

---

## 1. Updated Technology Stack

| Concern | Choice | Version |
|---|---|---|
| Language | Java | **21** |
| Framework | Spring Boot | **3.3.x** |
| Build tool | Maven | 3.x |
| ORM | Spring Data JPA + Hibernate | via Boot 3 |
| Database | PostgreSQL | 15+ |
| DTO mapping | MapStruct | **1.6.x** |
| Validation | Jakarta Bean Validation | via Boot 3 |
| API docs | SpringDoc OpenAPI | **2.5.x** |
| JSON | Jackson + jsr310 | via Boot 3 |
| Utility | Lombok | latest |
| Migration | **Flyway** | via Boot 3 |
| Testing | JUnit 5 | via Boot 3 |

> ⚠️ **Critical**: Spring Boot 3 uses `jakarta.*` not `javax.*`.
> Every `@Valid`, `@NotBlank`, `@Column` import changes. Don't copy Boot 2 code blindly.

