## 14. Suhba-specific Pitfalls

| Pitfall | Fix |
|---|---|
| Using `ddl-auto=update` instead of Flyway | Schema drift will bite you when you add columns later |
| Doing distance math in SQL (PostGIS not needed at Vienna scale) | Bounding box in DB + Haversine in Java is simpler and fast enough |
| Exposing `/approve` without auth | Add `@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')")` before launch |
| Missing index on lat/lng columns | Already in V1/V2 migrations above |
| `javax.*` imports from copied Boot 2 code | Always `jakarta.*` in Boot 3 |
| Upvotes with no spam protection | Track `(userId, spotId)` or IP+spotId in a separate table |